<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Muthsidi kwa Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Muthsidi kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="rem">LK, RS, MB, MN, TC, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Yame no Paulu, kanganda ka Krisitu Yesu keshima ya Nyambi, na ni tumiwa ku tongora yo thsikumbwethzo thso mwoyo ethsi thsi di mwa Krisitu Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />naa ñorera Timoti mwanange oyu na shima, Nyambi Tata na Krisitu Yesu Fumu wetu a ku pe thsihemo, ñeke no thsiyaro.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okanderero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Naa kanderera kwa Nyambi oyu ni kwamena, ko mumoneno ouwa eci edi a tendire akwathsañurwange, naa ku vurukanga mwirombero yange thsikati thsothsihe mutenya nothsiku. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ou ni na vurukanga mihothzi thzoe, naa fotanga nene ci nga ni na ku mono, ci nga nikare no thsinyanyu thsothsikuru.<verse eid="2TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Naa vuruka thsitawo thsoe thsoshemwa, thsitawo ethsi a tangire kwikara nathso kuku woe Loisi no mama woe Yunisi, naa tawa shemwa ci nowe thsodiyo ethsi o di nathso. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Mweyo, naa ku vurukithsa ci o yuumithse karo thsipa thsa Nyambi, ethsi no piwa ko ku ku kambeka kwange moko. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Inene Nyambi ka na a tu pa Mupepo o wowa, unone okoro, thsishimo no ku cihenga.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Mweyo, wa fera honyi ombangi wa Fumu wetu, nji ku fera honyi ame no thsinthzinda thsenthzi. Unone o ni kwatithse mu ku nyandera Muthzimbu Ouwa kokoro ou naa ku pa Nyambi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Yodiyo na a tu yoyithsa no ku twithsera ku mwoyo oukenu, kadi mukaci kekwama yetu, unone mukaci kesheteka yenthzi no thsihemo thsenthzi. Ethsi thsihemo shime a thsi tu pire kare mwa Krisitu Yesu kaye o ku ka shime no kumbiwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Unone ethso thsihemo na thsi hokoriwa ku kwetu ko kuhokoka kwa Muyoyithsi wetu Krisitu Yesu, aye oyu na a pwithsa okoro o kufa, no ku reta mwoyo no kukana ku fa ko Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Oo Muthzimbu Ouwa odiyo na hangweriwire kwikara mukwakuhonga, kanganda no murongithsi.<verse eid="2TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Eyo ngeyi ni nyandera kenge, unone ka i ni fithsire honyi, inene ni na dimuka oyu ni na tawa, karo ni na dimuka shemwa ci aa twethsa ku nyunga eyi ni na paka mu moko enthzi shime ku ka kuma mu diyuwa dyo ku ka huka kwenthzi. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Eyi no yuvu ku kwange, o i hengeke ikare muro werongithsa yoshemwa ko thsitawo no thsishimo mwa Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />O nyunge enu yoiwa eyi na i pakiwa mu moko oe, o i nyunge ko ku kwathsiwa ku Mupepo Oukenu oyu di mu mwetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />O na dimuka ci anu wahe o mu ditunga dya Asia na ni yeuka, amweya ku kwo po a Figelusi na Hemogenesi.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Fumu ekare no ñeke ku mwanda wa Onesifora, inene wa ni roerithsangire ku mucima rorungi no ku ni tanarithsa. Karo ka a ni fererire honyi shaanga ci shime nekarire mu madyenge. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Unone ou a na kumine mu Roma wa ni fotafotire nene shime ou a ni wanine. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Fumu a ku monithse Onesifora ñeke mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero. Nowe o na dimuka nawanawa edi a ni kwathsire o ku tu di mu Efese.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="rem">MN, RS, MB, MN, TC, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Dishwarare dyodiwa dya Krisitu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Eciko owe mwanange, o tanarithsiwe ko thsihemo ethsi thsi di mwa Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Enu eyi no yuvu o ku ni amba pa meho o mambangi oangi, o i pake mu moko anu o ku rurama awa a ku twethsa nawo ku i rongithsa amweya.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />O nyandere pofoci nange eci dishwarare dyodiwa dya Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Kwithsa dishwarare dyo kwingena mwinu yayo yo mwoyo, pakuninga ci eshima yenthzi po ku roerithsa ñathsire wenthzi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Mofoci no munu o kwikara mu rakaraka, tumba a wana muyambo shime ngeci aa shupwera mirao. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Njimi o ku tanara ku kwama yo na roera ku wana dicora dyo kutanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />O cikupure nawa eyi ni amba, inene Fumu kenge a ku ku pa mathsaano mwinu yoihe.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />O anekere Yesu Krisitu o mu mukuta wa Davida oyu wa pinduriwire kwafu. Ou po odiyo Muthzimbu Ouwa ou ni honga. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Mukaci ko ku honga ou Muthzimbu Ouwa, naa nyandithsiwa no kwangiwa no madyenge eci no thsikeremi. Unone diywi dya Nyambi po ka dyangiwire. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Mweyo, naa cithzua mucima mwinu yoihe mukaci kowa na a hangura Nyambi, ci nawo a wane kuyoyithsiwa no kutethzima ko diyere mwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Edi diambo dya shemwa dyo kuninga ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Ngeci twaa fa nenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">no ku yoya kenge twa ku yoya nenthzi,<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />ngeci atwepo tu cithzua mu makando,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">no ku tumina kenge twa ku tumina nenthzi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ngeci atwepo tu mu hamura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">naye kenge a ku tu hamura.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Ngeci ka tu ruramine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">aye kenge a kwikarerera kengeyo o mururami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">inene tumba a cihamura yothsinda.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukwakukwama o muwawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />O wa vurukithse eyi enu. Karo o wa nomenithse pa meho a Nyambi ci a cikanyeka yo maywi, edyo dikanyi dyo kengeyo tumba di kwathsa thsimweya, dya epithsa pohuma awa i teerera. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />O kwame momuhe omu o na twethsera ku cipa pa meho a Nyambi ko kwikara oyu na tawethziwa, mukwakukwama o kukana ku fa honyi, o ku tongonona nawa muthzimbu oshemwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Unone o tunde kwiambaura i shiremeka Nyambi, inene enu yo kengeyo po yaa twara pohuma anu ku miyoyero thzo kupira thsitawo. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Erongithsa yo kenge ya ku yanduruka eci thsironda thso mbongora. Amweya kukwo po Himenea na Fileto, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />awa na yemburuka ku thsia oshemwa. A amba ci kupinduka kwafu po na ku tendahara kare, karo aepithsa thsitawo thsa amweya.<verse eid="2TI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Shaanga kengeyo, mushisho oukoro wa Nyambi ou naa shishi u na tanara, ou u na pakiwa thsitamba ko ku ñoriwa kenge ci: “Fumu na dimuka anuenthzi shemwa.” Karo ci “Yomuhe oyu na citawera ci wa Fumu a thsie omango ouhe.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mu nthzio thzothzikuru ka mu waniwire pohuma etenga yo gauda no silivera, unone mwaa waniwa netenga yetondo noma, imweya ya ku kwamithsa enu yo direma, imweya ya ku kwamithsa yo kupira direma. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Mweyo, munu yomuhe o ku cikenithsa kweyi yo kupira direma, kenge a kwikara thsitenga thso ku kwamithsa yo direma, karo o mukenu, no ku kwathsa nene kwa ñathsire wenthzi, karo o na ciroithsera ku kwama ekwama yoiwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />O yembuke kwicikumbwethza yoimango yoshumba, unone o koñomeke owawa, thsitawo, thsishimo no thsiyaro, pofoci kengeyo nowa ethsa Fumu ko mucima oukenu.<verse eid="2TI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Unone wa vanda ku dikanyi dyotomba no kukana ku dimuka thsimweya, inene nowe o na dimuka ci yaereka mamvo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Karo mupika Fumu ka a roerire marwamvu, unone aa roera kwikara no thsihemo kwanu wahe, karo aa roera ku twethsa ku rongithsa no ku kwatamucima. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Aa roera ku thsiurura ko kuwamucima awa mu rwithsa, kuinashimi Nyambi kenge a wa pa ndau thzo ku cera ci a dimuke oshemwa, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />apo honi maano o kenge a ku hukera nawa no ku thsevuka kwiteama ya shamaonga, oyu na a wa pukura ci a tende eshima yenthzi.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="rem">TA, RS, MB, MN, TC, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Mayuwa o mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Uno honi o dimuke kenge ci: Kenge kwa kwikara ekati yoikaru nene mu mayuwa o mahurerero. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Anu kenge a ku cishima awo athsinda pohuma, kenge mba shima nene madi, kenge mba cishangara, kenge mba cinuneka, kenge mba yengwera Nyambi, kenge mba shwahura ashemi wo, kenge mba pira okanderero, karo mbera kekara owakenu. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Mbera ka shimi amweya, mbera ka tetera amweya, kenge mbepithsa amweya mathzina, kenge mbekara no ruthziho, kenge mbekara no ñore, kenge mba thzimba yoiwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Kenge mba omba ambusho, kenge mbekara mangurunde, kenge mbekara o mununa nene, karo kenge mba shima nene ecikora kupita ku shima Nyambi. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Kenge mba monahara eci a di no mwoyo o thsitawo, unone kenge mba kana okoro wao. O tunde kwanu o kengeyo.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Inene amweya ku kwo aengenanga mu manthzio anu no ku othza ambuyama awa faratera, no ku remena mipango thzevi yo, karo aa endithsiwa kecikumbwethza yoimango yo ku cithsiathsia. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Ambuyama o kengeyo aa ereka ku cirongithsa enu yoipe thsikati thsothsihe unone dyawaca ku twethsa kwikara nodimukero oshemwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Dyodi a kanenine Mushe a Janesi na Jamburesi, nowa anu awa dya na kana oshemwa. Anu weanekera yo kwipa awa a di no thsitawo thso mbango. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Unone mbera ka henye kokure, inene anu wahe kenge a ku mona otomba wo eci edi ya tendaharire kwa Janesi na Jamburesi.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ethsiurura imweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Uno honi, owe Timoti po, no shupwera erongithsa yange, muyoyero wange, thsisheteka thsange mu mwoyo, thsitawo thsange, kukwatamucima kwange, thsishimo thsange, nothzui wange. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Karo o na dimuka kunyandithsiwa kwange, no makando ange. O na dimuka othzui wange mu makando uya na nyandithsiwire mu Antioke, mu Ikoniamu no mu Lisitira. Unone Fumu wa ni amwenine kweyi yoihe. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Yoshemwa, munu yomuhe oyu fota ku yoya mwoyo o thsitawo mwa Krisitu Yesu kenge a ku nyandithsiwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Unone akwetenda yoimango nakwakwangera kenge a ku hambakana mwitenda yo. Kenge a kwangera amweya, karo nawo kenge a kwangeriwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Scripture scrolls" file="hk00153b.tif" size="col" loc="2 Tim 3:13-16" copy="Knowles" ref="3.15-16">Mañoro efundo</figure><verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Uno honi eciko owe po, o tanarithse eyi no cirongithsa neyi no tawa shemwa, inene o na dimuka oyu naa i ku rongithsa. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Karo ku tunda ku wanuke woe o na dimuka Eñora yo Shokenu, eyi i twethsa ku ku pa onyanyami o kuyoyithsiwa ko thsitawo mwa Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Mañoro oahe a ñoriwire kotangerero<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Thsigerike thsaa amba ci “Nyambi wa a puyerire.”</char></note> o Mupepo wa Nyambi, aa kwathsa ku rongithsa oshemwa, ku kuturura, ku thsiurura no ku ronga munu ci a yoye kowawa, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />ci mupika Nyambi a ciroithsere nawa ku tenda ekwama yoihe yoiwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="rem">AM, RS, MB, MN, TC, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">O honge diywi dya Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Naa ku raerera pa meho a Nyambi no pa meho a Krisitu Yesu, oyu wa ku ratura ayumi nafu ou a ku hokoka ku na tungithsa Kutumina kwenthzi, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />o ciroithsere ku honga diywi dya Nyambi mwikati yoiwa no mwikati yoimango. O thsiurure, o kuturure no ku tanarithsa ko kukwatamucima kokukuru no kurongithsa.<verse eid="2TI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Inene thsikati thsaa keya ethsi a ku kana anu ku cithzua erongithsa yoshemwa. Kenge a ku shupwera eshima yo, no ku ciungumekera arongithsi owangi awa a ku wa tongwera eyi a fota awo ku yuva. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Kenge a ku thsia ku teerera oshemwa, no ku thsiurukera ku matangu.<verse eid="2TI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Uno honi owe o cihenge mwinu yoihe. O citanarithse mu makando, o kwame ekwama yo ngambi o diywi dya Nyambi, karo o kwanithserere ekwama yoe eyi no piwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Inene eci ameko po mwoyo wange na u tupuriwa kare eci thsiyambero kwa Nyambi, karo thsikati thsange thso ku thsia uno mwoyo pepi thsi di. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Na ni ru mvo thzothziwa, na ni kumu ku hura thzo rakaraka, karo na ni hengeka thsitawo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Pano honi, muyambo owawa u na ni taterera, ou a ku ni pa Fumu mwedyo diyuwa, aye mukwakuratura o kwononoka. Karo, ka a ku u pa ame pohuma, unone nowa wahe awa a na taterera nene ko thsishimo kuhokoka kwenthzi.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maywi kwa Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />O ereke momuhe omu o na twethsera ku keya ku kwange ko wanguwangu, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />inene Demasi, mu ku shima nene kwenthzi kano kaye, na a ni yeuka no ku thza ku Tesalonika. Kiresensi aye na a thzi ku Galatia, karo Tite na a thzi ku Dalumatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka pohuma yodiyo di nange. O shimbe Mareka o keye nenthzi, inene aa twethsa ku na ni kwathsa mwikwama yange. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tikike aye na ni mu tumu ku Efese. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Ou wa ku keya wa ku ni pitwere canthzi wange oya na ni thsii mu Toroasi kwa Kapasi. Karo wa ku ni pitwere no mavuka, nenepo mavuka etumba.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekisanda mukwakufura efu na a ni yuvithsa nene kukora. Fumu kenge a ku mu huthsera eci edi naa tende. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />O mu mamere nowe, inene naa shomorora nene maywi etu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Pa kuthzekithsiwa kwange ko kutanga kwithsa oyu wa nikarithsireko, unone wahe a ni yeukire. Nyambi a varera oo murandu kukwo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Unone Fumu wekarire nange no ku ni tanarithsa, ci nga ni twethse ku honga Muthzimbu Ouwa ko kuyara ci Anukenge wahe nga a u yuve. Karo na amweniwire ku kanwa ko nyime. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Fumu kenge a ku ni amwena kumango ouhe, no ku ni twara nawa mu Kutumina kwenthzi ko ku wiru. Ku kwenthzi kwikare kutethzima ko diyere na diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena ko mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />O ni vumenenene Purisila na Akwila no mwanda wa Onesifora. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasito na a thsiara mu Korinte, unone Tirofimo aye na ni mu thsii mu Mileta o ku kora. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />O ereke nene ci wa ku na kume kuno kufu o ku shime ku kuma. Yubulo, Pudenisi, Linusi, Kilaudia naenthzetu akwakutawa wahe aa ku vumenena.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Fumu ekare noe. Thsihemo thsa Nyambi thsikare nenu mwahe.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>